com/documentation/102162/0430/Using-ASTC-with-graphics-APIs and https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL/extensions/OES/OES_texture_compression_astc.txt ASTC extensions are packaged in the following 'tiers':\r\n\r\n`GL_KHR_texture_compression_astc_ldr` - 2d, LDR only.\r\n`GL_KHR_texture_compression_astc_sliced_3d` - 2d and sliced 3d, LDR only,\r\n`GL_KHR_texture_compression_astc_hdr` - 2d and sliced 3d, LDR and HDR,\r\n`GL_OES_texture_compression_astc` - 2d, sliced 3d, volumetric 3d, LDR and HDR ('full'),\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] I was unable to find any information regarding `GL_KHR_texture_compression_astc`, so I've decided to remove it. It has been present in the codebase since ASTC was first implemented in the engine, so it needs to be confirmed whether devices actually report it.\r\n- [x] According to https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc/ `WEBGL_compressed_texture_astc` can support both LDR and HDR profiles, and the function `getSupportedProfiles` may be used to query them.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","grav